---
title: For Fun Reading List
description: "Books I like to read when I'm not reading a 'Great Book'"
originalDate: 2026-10-31
draft: false
---

<p>When I'm not working on something from my <a href="{{ "commonplace/2026-06-07-great-books-reading-list.njk" | inputPathToUrl }}">great books reading list</a>, this is what I'm reading. Yes, I've read more books than this. I just haven't been keeping a list until now.</p>


<div id="readingList" class="feature" role="region" aria-labelledby="tableCaption" tabindex="0">
    <table role="table">
        <caption id="tableCaption">For Fun Reading List</caption>
        <thead role="rowgroup">
            <tr role="row">
                <th role="columnheader">Title</th>
                <th role="columnheader">Author</th>
                <th role="columnheader">Date Read</th>
                <th role="columnheader">Status</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody role="rowgroup">
        {% for book in books | reverse %}
            <tr data-status="{{ book.status }}" role="row">
                <td data-column="Title" role="cell">
                    {% if book.notesUrl %}
                        <a href="{{ book.notesUrl | inputPathToUrl }}">{{ book.title }}</a>
                    {% else %}
                        {{ book.title }}
                    {% endif %}
                </td>
                <td data-column="Author" role="cell">{{ book.author }}</td>
                <td data-column="Date Read" role="cell">{{ book.completionDate }}</td>
                <td data-column="Status" role="cell">{{ book.status }}</td>
            </tr>
        {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>
